---
/* 2. 信任条：窄横条，3 项图标文字。 */
---

<section class="band">
  <div class="container trust-row">
    <div class="trust-item reveal">
      <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 7v5l3.5 2M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18 9 9 0 0 0 0-18z" /></svg>
      </span>
      {/* 待确认：「三分钟」这个数字是否成立 */}
      <span data-placeholder="trust-timing">一张照片，三分钟出片</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-item reveal" data-delay="1">
      <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h7v6H4zM13 5h7v6h-7zM4 13h7v6H4zM13 13h7v6h-7z" /></svg>
      </span>
      <span>10 种玩法，图文 · AI · 视频 · 纪念</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-item reveal" data-delay="2">
      <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 11V8a7 7 0 0 0-14 0v3M4 11h16v10H4z" /></svg>
      </span>
      <span>照片仅用于生成，可随时删除</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
